flowchart TD
  D[Doctor: published loopback bindings] --> C[Read proxy CA/publications]
  O[Open: loopback-only DNS candidates] --> C
  C -->|Unavailable| U[Doctor warns; open proceeds]
  C -->|Verified runtime root| B{Published on loopback?}
  B -->|No| K[Skip intentional binds]
  B -->|Yes| P[Probe with short timeout]
  P -->|HTTPS| T[Verify CA and SNI]
  P -->|HTTP| H[Check TCP reachability]
  T -->|Valid| S[Endpoint passes]
  H -->|Connected| S
  T -->|Timeout or verification failure| F[Doctor warns per endpoint]
  H -->|Timeout or refusal| F
  F --> Q{Healthy alternate path?}
  Q -->|Yes| S
  Q -->|No| R[Open refuses URL output]
  class S ok
  class P wait
  class F,R fail
  class U,K idle
